  "details": "# Issue:\n\nThe Expressions Wing of the Quick / Main Menu should normally replicate the Expressions Menu of the Action Wheel. This is currently not the case though, as the new Avatar Height slider is missing from it.\n\nSame thing goes for the Release Poses button btw, but there is already a canny for that one:  \n\nhttps://feedback.vrchat.com/bug-reports/p/1236release-poses-is-missing-from-wing-menu-expressions\n\n# Expected Behavior:  \n\nAll the Avatar Quick Actions of them Action Menu should also be in the Expressions Wing. So please add the Avatar Height Slider to it as well. (And maybe also the Release Poses option if you are already at it)\n\n# Attachments:  \n\nHere are pictures showcasing the issue:",
